  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eXoO/174",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">2026년도 현장과학교육학회 정기학술대회를 10월 17일(토) 서울대학교 시흥캠퍼스&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #666666;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">컨벤션센터에서 다음과 같이 개최합니다.</span></p><p>오전에 <span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">김영학 수석님</span>의 초청강연이 있습니다&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">주제</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">과학교육의 현장과 성찰</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">연구하는 교사</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">,&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">실천하는 연구자</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">일시</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">: 2026.10.17(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">토</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">) 9:00 ~ 18:00</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">장소</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">서울대학교 시흥캠퍼스 컨벤션센터</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">4)&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">사전등록 기간</span><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">: 2026.08.17.(</span><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">월</span><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">) - 2026.10.8.(</span><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">목</span><span style=\"color: #3a32c3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">5)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">등록 방법</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">한국현장과학교육학회 홈페이지</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"http://www.kosss.org/conference02/intro.asp\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">http://www.kosss.org/conference02/intro.asp</a></span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;학술대회-사전등록</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">에서 신청</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; &#160; 회원이 신규 회원과 함께 사전등록 할 경우 신규 회원의 등록비는 면제됩니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; &#160; &#160;1+1 찬스를 활용하세요!&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; &#160; 또한&#160; 5년 이하 신임 교사의 경우 등록비는 면제됩니다.&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">많은 신청 바랍니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7391403367a40fb7bd5aa114460772a84c0a0fb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"764\" height=\"441\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7391403367a40fb7bd5aa114460772a84c0a0fb\" data-origin-width=\"2327\" data-origin-height=\"1342\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40340d04919a0fffed9ea619e3008409431226d3\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"583\" height=\"875\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40340d04919a0fffed9ea619e3008409431226d3\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1536\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4eae6cb5557c2296a851b932dc216cfb1f30becc\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"582\" height=\"872\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4eae6cb5557c2296a851b932dc216cfb1f30becc\" data-origin-width=\"681\" data-origin-height=\"1020\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
